<title>UK: Iceland says like for like sales up one pct.</title>
<headline>Iceland says like for like sales up one pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British frozen food chain Iceland Group Plc said on Thursday that overall like for like sales in the year to date were up 1.0 percent versus the comparable period last year.</p>
</text>
